soak-store/
/4
/6
.worktrees/
# ---- own-format wallet user data (NOT Core's wallet.dat) ----
# Live under the durable runtime directory data/ (which is already ignored
# wholesale below). bmcwallet.dat is our own BMC-formatted encrypted wallet
# (see wallet_store.c); bmcwallet.dat.pass is the dev-side secret; txlog and
# addressbook derive from the same base. Some paths are CWD-relative, so they
# only land under data/ when run from the project root. Kept explicit here in
# case the blanket data/ ignore is ever narrowed.
data/bmcwallet.dat
data/bmcwallet.dat.pass
data/addressbook.dat
# ---- Full-chain differential resume/progress state (scratch, not a deliverable) ----
validation/fullchain_state/

